edge((2,2),(3,2),"->",[$y$]),
edge((2,2),(1,2),"->",[$s$],stroke:(dash:"dashed"),shift:2pt))]
]
Since $upright(i m) f arrow.r B$ is monic, $A arrow.r upright(c o i m) f$ is epi, $g\,h$ both induce $upright(c o i m) f arrow.r^phi.alt upright(i m) f$, then $phi.alt$ is monic and epi hence iso

