#statement("Exercise")[
Suppose $X\,Y$ are vector fields on $M$, $phi.alt : M arrow.r N$ is a smooth map, then $phi.alt_(*)\[X\,Y\]=\[phi.alt_(*) X\,phi.alt_(*) Y\]$

]#label("Naturality of Lie bracket")
#proof(title: "Solution")[
Apply Exercise #ref(label("Pushforward of vector field"), supplement: none) #display-equation($phi.alt_(*)\[X\,Y\]\(f\) & =\[X\,Y\]\(f compose phi.alt\)\
 & = X\(Y\(f compose phi.alt\)\)- Y\(X\(f compose phi.alt\)\)\
 & = X\(\(\(phi.alt_(*) Y\)f\)compose phi.alt\)- Y\(\(\(phi.alt_(*) X\)f\)compose phi.alt\)\
 & =\(\(phi.alt_(*) X\)\(phi.alt_(*) Y\)f\)compose phi.alt -\(\(phi.alt_(*) Y\)\(phi.alt_(*) X\)f\)compose phi.alt\
 & =\(\[phi.alt_(*) X\,phi.alt_(*) Y\]f\)compose phi.alt\
